From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:04:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mmc: sunxi: Add the Allwinner A733 eMMC
 controller

The A733 has two kinds of SD/MMC host controller: SMHC0 and SMHC1 for
SD and SDIO with a 4 bit bus, SMHC2 and SMHC3 for eMMC with an 8 bit
bus and DDR at 200 MHz, which is HS400. One compatible for both lets a
driver give the SD controller features only the eMMC controller has.

Add allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc with the A100 eMMC controller as
fallback, as the H616 and A523 eMMC controllers have it.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the eMMC node with this compatible bound to
the driver and ran at HS400 with enhanced strobe.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml         | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
index 9e9610bb1eda..1acd4b7ba9db 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
@@ -51,6 +51,7 @@ properties:
               - allwinner,sun20i-d1-emmc
               - allwinner,sun50i-h616-emmc
               - allwinner,sun55i-a523-emmc
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-a100-emmc
       - items:
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-h616-mmc
